# JDBC thin 11.2 (ojdbc6 11.2.0.3)'s first DATA message to 11.2.0.2 (#2854):
# its ANO request, the deadbeef container stamped 10.2 (0a 20 00 00).
# Captured 2026-11-27 through tools/capture_proxy.py. The TTC payload,
# without the packet's header, as `hexdump -C` output; the offset column
# and the |ascii| gutter are ignored by tests.replay.parse_hexdump.
00000000  de ad be ef 00 92 0a 20  00 00 00 04 00 00 04 00  |....... ........|
00000010  03 00 00 00 00 00 04 00  05 0a 20 00 00 00 08 00  |.......... .....|
00000020  01 09 09 09 09 09 09 09  09 00 12 00 01 de ad be  |................|
00000030  ef 00 03 00 00 00 04 00  04 00 01 00 02 00 03 00  |................|
00000040  01 00 03 00 00 00 00 00  04 00 05 0a 20 00 00 00  |............ ...|
00000050  02 00 03 e0 e1 00 02 00  06 fc ff 00 02 00 02 00  |................|
00000060  00 00 00 00 04 00 05 0a  20 00 00 00 0c 00 01 00  |........ .......|
00000070  01 08 0a 06 03 02 0b 0c  0f 10 11 00 03 00 02 00  |................|
00000080  00 00 00 00 04 00 05 0a  20 00 00 00 03 00 01 00  |........ .......|
00000090  01 03                                             |..|
00000092
